nt manager at Youhei's all-boys dorm. She was Hikarizaka's first female student council president when she was in high school. She achieved a full week of perfect attendance for the whole student body and she was loved by the students. Misae is friendly with the dorm students but strict when it comes to the dorm rules. She is also well liked by the rugby members. Depending on decisions, Tomoya can change her to a violent dorm lady through his lecture."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c15851"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/72/7254d50b6f79e1e3738cb3094454607f044bf3a35d6006bd2d47e9460ea28cc5.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9f/9f0dabfec371ab1ce093db926dfd7e3ed27cf57567147a83a5954f7e152d6fe2.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"雪野 五月","creatorId":"vndb:s474","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s474","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s474","name":"ゆきの さつき","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:26150","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c15852","characterName":"芳野 祐介","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c15852"},"originalCharacterName":"芳野 祐介","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"1205"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"179"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"63"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Yusuke is an electrician who once attended Hikarizaka high school and lived as a rock musician. Tomoya first met Yusuke during a street light accident involving a person's car, and assists Yusuke in his work. Yusuke is engaged to Kouko, and is also one of the reasons why Fuko exists in the school. He marries Kouko in the middle of the School Life arc and first season of the anime."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c15852"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5c/5cbddf704ccd2e0e06d9a08884c8d98a985ba47f6c1c2a70759178ac26ef95b6.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7b/7b100be2ae3ccf9ddca6fce68bb77255bec8c77349021661bcb16c14ed3057ac.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"緑川 光","creatorId":"vndb:s73","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s73","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s73","name":"緑川 光","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:26143","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c15853","characterName":"伊吹 公子","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c15853"},"originalCharacterName":"伊吹 公子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"118"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"ab"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"161"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"49"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Kouko is Fuko's older sister. She used to be an art teacher at Hikarizaka high school, and she treats everyone kindly. Kouko is one of the familiar faces in the Furukawa Bakery, and Nagisa admires her very much, being her former art teacher."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c15853"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-asse